{"a":[92,92],"h":"<p>İşte ya Muhammed sen bütün bunlara o mübîn nezîr olduğunu söyle 92.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"79\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 79.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 33.0 33.0 33.0 39.7 48.0 56.2\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.4 39.7 48.0 56.2 63.0\" y=\"25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> imdi rabbına kasem olsun ki<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"157\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 157.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 27.0 33.7 33.7 40.6 49.6 49.6 61.6 77.3 77.3 86.3 86.3 94.6 94.6 101.3 108.0 114.7 126.7 133.6\" y=\"25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.6 40.6 61.6 94.6 101.3 108.0 114.7 126.7 133.6 141.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> elbette ve elbette onların hepsine soracağız - gerek böyle muktesimlerin ve gerek sunufı keferenin cümlesini 93. </p>"}